StyleSmuggler deferred-directives fix, magento/framework half

One half of patches/stylesmuggler-deferred-directives-fix-247-248-249.patch. The combined patch touches two
packages, which a plugin that patches per package cannot handle, so it is split
here. Paths are left as vendor/magento/..., which those plugins resolve through
their -p4 fallback.

Package : magento/framework
Magento : 2.4.7, 2.4.8 and 2.4.9, every patch level
Origin  : https://gist.github.com/pingiun/00cfbfdc3cf517807eb3b6bc24c7f295

Both halves are required; applying only one leaves the fix incomplete.

